                                        "text": "/** The picked folder's own name: the last part of its tree id (`primary:Backups` is shown as `Backups`), or the URI itself when it has none. */\nprivate fun folderName(uri: String): String {\n    val last = Uri.parse(uri).lastPathSegment ?: return uri\n    return last.substringAfterLast(':').ifEmpty { last }\n}\n"
